{"description":"HYBRED CULTURE CLUB × RUN IT BACK x PLAYA BOWL - 5K Shakeout Run\nToronto, we're bringing the community together for a HYROX 5K Shakeout Run!\nWhether you're gearing up for HYROX Toronto, training for your next race, or simply looking to get some miles in with good people, this one's for you.\nJoin us for a 5K community run starting at Lakeshore Blvd and Strachan (South Side) and finishing at Playa Bowls at The Well.\nAfter the run, stick around, connect with the crew, and refuel with some post-run bowls and smoothies!\nEVENT DETAILS\n📅 Date: Friday, October 2nd\n⏰ Time: 6:30 PM\n📍 Meeting Point: Lakeshore Blvd and Strachan (South Side)\n🏁 Finish Line: Playa Bowls at The Well\n🏃 Distance: 5KM\nPOST-RUN PERKS 🥣\n10% off on bowls and smoothies for all runners.\n5 FREE Playa Bowls up for grabs!\nGood vibes, new connections, and a chance to meet the Toronto running and HYROX community.\nAll paces and fitness levels are welcome. Come solo, bring a friend, or pull up with your crew.\nLIVE THE CULTURE, HYBRED.","organizer":"Hybred Culture Club"}